{"id":"31607a9fe3d8287b","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-lob.md","title":"Löb's Theorem","display":"thm-lob — Löb's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-lob","aliases":["88-thm-lob"],"display":"thm-lob — Löb's Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-lob-theorem]]","[[88-df-provability-predicate]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-inference-rule]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-classical-calculus]]","[[88-lem-numeral-functional-representation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-lob"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-lob</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lob — Löb's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"499d6d1436229742\" href=\"?note=499d6d1436229742\" title=\"88-df-lob-theorem\">88-df-lob-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"254200a991dbb642\" href=\"?note=254200a991dbb642\" title=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" href=\"?note=f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" title=\"88-lem-numeral-functional-representation\">88-lem-numeral-functional-representation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (formal theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T\">\\(Q\\subseteq T\\)</span> (extension of Robinson arithmetic)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> (Gödel numbering)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\)</span> (Gödel-numbering predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\\)</span> (effective inference rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\\)</span> (effective axiomatizability, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(v)\">\\(\\Pr(v)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\">\\(\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\)</span> (standard provability formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\\)</span> 的公理与规则包含条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a>；仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}\\)</span> 并不提供这些逻辑规则。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对角代入所需的逐输入唯一输出表示来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" href=\"?note=f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" title=\"88-lem-numeral-functional-representation\">88-lem-numeral-functional-representation</a>，不把图关系可表示自动当作理论内函数唯一性。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\nT\\vdash_R\n\\bigl(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\to\nT\\vdash_R\\varphi\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob} \\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\nT\\vdash_R\n\\bigl(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\to\nT\\vdash_R\\varphi\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr\">\\(\\Pr\\)</span> : 标准对象语言可证性公式 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"254200a991dbb642\" href=\"?note=254200a991dbb642\" title=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner\\)</span> : Gödel编码 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li>Löb定理：如果“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>可证蕴涵<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>”在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>内可证，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>可证</li>\n<li>模态逻辑GL的算术对应 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"499d6d1436229742\" href=\"?note=499d6d1436229742\" title=\"88-df-lob-theorem\">88-df-lob-theorem</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"499d6d1436229742","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"254200a991dbb642","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":